## Decisions
- 2026-04-25: STORY-591 seeded. Large scope, critical criticality. Generic pattern for all GC projects. Zero changes to advertising-amazon (STORY-592 handles that).
- 2026-04-25: Phase 4 complete. Approach A (Full Phase 10c) selected. Key mitigations: per-contract `blocking: true` flag, business-level contract template examples, direct violation→health coupling, lint enforcement of criticality field at Phase 11.
- 2026-04-25: Phase 6 complete. Full design: specification.md (10 sections), architecture.md (component map + data flows), api-design.md (/api/status JSON + /status HTML + violation events + Grafana template), implementation-plan.md (4 groups, 10 tasks).
- 2026-04-25: Phases 6b/6c/6d complete (parallel). Security: 10 findings (2 High — violation event PII, test fixture credentials). UX: accessibility blockers (color-blind, WCAG contrast, mobile viewport). Ops: 3 High gaps (restart state loss, multi-replica inconsistency, /health vs /api/status separation).

